# The Budget Head returns it with feedback on the section.
nav http://127.0.0.1:5173/
? click button | Sign out
nav http://127.0.0.1:5173/
type #login-username | BUD_Jose
type #login-password | Office123!
click button[type=submit] |
wait Proposals
click .nav-item | Proposals
click .tab | Awaiting my office
